  "description": "Original team 'Sales' from cobusgreyling/grok-bot-templates@4f3f28b4e657 (MIT): lead sales-outbound; bots sales-outbound, meeting-prep, call-followup. Why: Outbound volume is useless if the next call is unbriefed and the recap never gets written down before it is sent. Group kickoff (original): @Outbound research the named account list and stop at a review list. @Meeting Prep brief the next booked call as INTERNAL. @Call Follow-up wait for notes, then draft an unsent recap. Do not send. Do not enroll anyone. Do not book the next meeting.",
